WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.469
Video five. The Gateway, the keys, and Go To.

00:00:04.769 --> 00:00:08.187
This is the Gateway of Hisaab. Your work
starts here.

00:00:08.217 --> 00:00:13.433
On the left: the current period, the current
date, your companies, and the last backup.

00:00:13.463 --> 00:00:18.549
On the right: the menu. Use the arrow keys, or
press the blue letter of an item.

00:00:18.579 --> 00:00:22.129
B opens the Balance Sheet. Esc brings you
back.

00:00:22.808 --> 00:00:28.091
The top bar has the menus, from Company to
Help. Alt and the blue letter opens each one.

00:00:28.121 --> 00:00:31.472
The button bar on the right shows the keys of
each screen.

00:00:32.621 --> 00:00:38.370
Alt+K opens the Company menu: create, alter,
change, select or shut a company.

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:40.483
Esc closes it.

00:00:41.563 --> 00:00:44.981
Alt+G is Go To. It works on every screen.

00:00:45.011 --> 00:00:49.895
Type a part of a name, for example trial. The
list shows only what fits.

00:00:50.011 --> 00:00:54.160
Enter opens the Trial Balance. Esc brings you
back to the Gateway.

00:00:55.392 --> 00:01:01.011
F2 changes the current date. Type the new
date, for example 30-6-26.

00:01:01.041 --> 00:01:06.526
Ctrl+A accepts. The Gateway now shows
30-Jun-2026. New vouchers take this date.

00:01:07.606 --> 00:01:12.356
Alt+F3 opens Select Company. It lists every
company in your data folder.

00:01:12.606 --> 00:01:17.692
Type a part of the name, and press Enter. The
company opens next to the first one.

00:01:19.406 --> 00:01:24.088
F3 changes the current company. The list shows
the companies that are open.

00:01:24.406 --> 00:01:28.891
Select one, and press Enter. The current
company is in bold.

00:01:29.371 --> 00:01:35.523
The keys of this video: Alt+G for Go To, F2
for the date, and F3 for the company.

00:01:35.453 --> 00:01:40.539
Alt+F3 to select a company, Ctrl+A to accept,
and Esc to go back.

00:01:40.469 --> 00:01:44.219
Alt+K for the Company menu, and Enter to open
a line.

00:01:44.419 --> 00:01:48.169
Now you know the keys. The next video creates
a company.

